    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>]</mo></math> for which the system of linear equations<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />has non-trivial solution.Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>120</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>&#952;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
